---
layout: base.njk
lang: en
permalink: /en/
alt: /
title: "Renovation company in Bologna, free quote | CHR Costruzioni"
description: "Full renovations, bathrooms, kitchens, roofs and waterproofing in Bologna and its province. Over 12 years of experience. Free site visit and quote. English spoken."
---
{% from "macro.njk" import vid, card %}
{% set L = lingue.en %}
{% set pia = lavori | trovaLavoro('pianoro-ristrutturazione-completa') %}
<div class="wrap hero">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">Building company in Bologna and its province</span>
    <h1>Full renovations, done right.</h1>
    <p class="lead">We renovate houses and apartments, redo bathrooms and kitchens, and waterproof balconies, terraces and roofs. One company that takes care of the job from start to finish, and we speak English.</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/en/quote/">Ask for a free quote</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/our-work/">See our work</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figure>
    <a href="/en/our-work/pianoro-ristrutturazione-completa/"><img src="/media/img/hero-pianoro.jpg" alt="Living room renovated in Pianoro, with herringbone wood floor and French doors onto the garden" width="1254" height="1254"></a>
    <figcaption>Full renovation, Pianoro (BO)</figcaption>
  </figure>
</div>

<div class="facts">
  <div><strong>Over 12 years</strong><span>of experience in the trade</span></div>
  <div><strong>Bologna and province</strong><span>the area we cover</span></div>
  <div><strong>Free</strong><span>site visit and quote</span></div>
</div>

<section class="band white"><div class="wrap split" style="align-items:center">
  <div class="stack">
    <span class="eyebrow">Featured project</span>
    <h2>Pianoro: a house rebuilt from scratch</h2>
    <p>{{ pia.descrizione_en }}</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/en/our-work/pianoro-ristrutturazione-completa/">See the project</a></p>
  </div>
  <figure class="featured-video">{{ vid(pia.video[0], 'en') }}</figure>
</div></section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">What we do</span><h2>From a whole house to a single bathroom</h2></div>
    <div class="services">
      <a class="svc" href="/en/renovations-bologna/"><img src="/media/img/pia-11.jpg" alt="French door onto the garden in a renovated house" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>Full renovations</h3><p>Turnkey apartments and houses: demolition, plumbing and wiring, floors, finishes.</p><span class="more">Find out more</span></div></a>
      <a class="svc" href="/en/bathrooms-kitchens-bologna/"><img src="/media/img/bagno4-lavabo.jpg" alt="Countertop basin on a wooden vanity in a renovated bathroom" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>Bathrooms and kitchens</h3><p>Complete or partial makeovers, with new plumbing and materials chosen with you.</p><span class="more">Find out more</span></div></a>
      <a class="svc" href="/en/roofs-waterproofing-bologna/"><img src="/media/img/f08.jpg" alt="Terrace levelled and waterproofed" loading="lazy"><div class="txt"><h3>Roofs and waterproofing</h3><p>Balconies, terraces and roofs: waterproof membranes, roof replacement and fall-protection lines.</p><span class="more">Find out more</span></div></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span><h2>From site visit to handover</h2></div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>Site visit</h3><p>We come and see the job, free and with no obligation.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Clear quote</h3><p>You get a detailed written quote, item by item.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Works</h3><p>One point of contact runs the site and keeps you updated on progress.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Handover</h3><p>We check the finished work together and leave the site clean.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band white">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">Recent work</span><h2>From the job site</h2></div>
    <div class="gallery">
      {{ card(lavori | trovaLavoro('pianoro-ristrutturazione-completa'), L, 'en') }}
      {{ card(lavori | trovaLavoro('bagno-con-lavabo-d-appoggio'), L, 'en') }}
      {{ card(lavori | trovaLavoro('installazione-linea-vita'), L, 'en') }}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/our-work/">All our work</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band navy"><div class="wrap cta-band">
  <div class="stack" style="gap:8px"><span class="eyebrow">Instagram</span><h2>Follow us on Instagram</h2><p>On our profile you will find more photos and videos of our jobs.</p></div>
  <a class="btn btn-light" href="https://www.instagram.com/{{ impresa.instagram }}/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Go to @{{ impresa.instagram }}</a>
</div></section>

<section class="band"><div class="wrap split" style="align-items:center">
  <figure style="margin:0;justify-self:center;width:100%;max-width:420px"><img src="/media/img/pia-12.jpg" alt="Small white dog by the French door in the renovated house in Pianoro, on the herringbone floor" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 70%;border-radius:4px"></figure>
  <div class="stack">
    <span class="eyebrow">At handover</span>
    <h2>A home ready to live in</h2>
    <p>We finish the job, clean up and hand over a home you can move into. This is the Pianoro house after the works, already lived in.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/en/quote/">Ask for a free quote</a></p>
  </div>
</div></section>

{% if recensioni.elenco.length %}
<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><span class="eyebrow">What clients say</span><h2>Customer reviews</h2></div>
    <div class="reviews">{% for r in recensioni.elenco %}<blockquote class="review"><span class="stars" aria-label="{{ r.stelle }} out of 5 stars">{% for i in range(0, r.stelle) %}★{% endfor %}</span><p>{{ r.testo }}</p><footer>{{ r.nome }}{% if r.luogo %}, {{ r.luogo }}{% endif %}</footer></blockquote>{% endfor %}</div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
